{"name": "Fame Or Folly", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"139\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/bfecf58ff3b7cb2687c02886320d5067.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"571\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/6bfe5ea67c0d25f23319a935e2e28f70.poster.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"880\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/6bfe5ea67c0d25f23319a935e2e28f70.webm?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/6bfe5ea67c0d25f23319a935e2e28f70.mp4?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Fame or Folly, you build your performance with every trouper you bring to the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every card you draw has a chance to change your performance. Synergize troupers together, boost them with gameplay-modifying banners, and excite the crowd to build approval. But watch out; some cards build tension in the crowd, and if you outrage the town they\u2019ll drive you out! Each draw pushes your luck: will you hit a powerful combo, or lose it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"122\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/844e2c04431bb777361746e6787ae1b9.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"631\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"402\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/0f13faafb711cddad14f10ba80b3b28f.poster.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/0f13faafb711cddad14f10ba80b3b28f.webm?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/0f13faafb711cddad14f10ba80b3b28f.mp4?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Welcome to a vibrant Renaissance kingdom where conflicts are no longer settled on the battlefield, but on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The King has established a Grand Festival to maintain the peace, and you\u2019re a travelling troupe with your eyes set on the final stage. In your world applause is currency, silence is death, and a perfect performance is more powerful than any sword. Lead your ragtag caravan from the mud of village squares to the marble floors of the Royal Court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br/><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"127\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/3109d18aa28d618772176a16f7d27b56.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"618\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/d5ece5c29c6aa09388429dd44fbdf889.poster.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"630\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/d5ece5c29c6aa09388429dd44fbdf889.webm?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/d5ece5c29c6aa09388429dd44fbdf889.mp4?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  To survive the critics and hecklers, you must master the synergies between your cast members. There are five distinct trouper classes, and balancing them is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minstrels</strong>:  The backbone of your show, generating your raw score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vendors</strong>: Earn coin to fund recruitment of new talent and powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mystics</strong>:\u00a0 Use arcane abilities to bend the rules of the stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outcasts</strong>: High-risk, high-reward troublemakers who provide massive multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wardens</strong>:  Keep the crowd in check, and prevent being run out of town.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine them with <strong>over 100 Banners</strong> and rare items to create explosive, performance-defining combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"122\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/eddb6db46729c40185873938cab1cfd4.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"580\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"220\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/f123bf7572831eb988b0d7c63132df16.poster.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"680\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/f123bf7572831eb988b0d7c63132df16.webm?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/f123bf7572831eb988b0d7c63132df16.mp4?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stakes couldn\u2019t be higher. The winner of the Grand Festival will be granted a single, binding wish from the King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every village you impress and every noble you dazzle brings you one step closer to the capital, and one step closer to performing for the King. But be warned: push too hard and the crowd will riot. Only the boldest plays will secure the fame necessary to stand on the grand stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/601c7618efd2c4105c28815aa860ff41.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"564\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"294\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/08a423290b290ea7e5f5924759e3ab17.poster.avif?t=1787513477\" width=\"830\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/08a423290b290ea7e5f5924759e3ab17.webm?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/extras/08a423290b290ea7e5f5924759e3ab17.mp4?t=1787513477\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a huge range of troupers, banners, and props designed with strategy in mind, <strong>Fame or Folly</strong> is built for infinite replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 15 Starting Decks: </strong>Distinct modifiers that shape your opening strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 150+ Trouper Cards: </strong>Every performer brings unique subtext and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022\u00a0100+ Banners: </strong>Game-changing augments that rewrite the rules of play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 22 Prop Variants: </strong>Single use items for a myriad of situations<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 24 Letters of Marque: </strong>Secure permanent buffs for your current run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 1-Hour Runs: </strong>Perfect for \u201cone more run\u201d sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is your chance to conquer the stage. Will your strategy win fame, or end in folly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "The outrageous traveling troupe roguelike deckbuilder. Put on shows across the kingdom, push your luck at the risk of upsetting the crowd. Pivot your deck using a variety of cards, banners, and props. Become the king of the festival either solo or in ranked multiplayer!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198020/282f81c0a20a421e7ed81649828535ff01a1b433/header.jpg?t=1787513477", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Deckbuilding", "Strategy", "Roguelike", "Card Game", "2D"], "developers": "Grand Games Studio", "publishers": "Grand Games Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4198020", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Lgy3mY5EV3w", "first_seen": 1777852800.0, "review_rank": 692}